# Dedicated OG images for new articles

For **new** blog / příručka / podcast articles, prefer a **dedicated `og_image`**, not only the site-wide default social image.

## Spec

- Size: **1200×630** (Open Graph)
- Source: usually crop/adapt the article’s main photo
- Files:
  - JPG: `apps/vzhurudolu/src/assets/img/content/{slug}-og.jpg`
  - WebP: `apps/vzhurudolu/public/assets/img/content/dest/{slug}-og.webp`
- Front matter: `og_image: /assets/img/content/dest/{slug}-og.webp`
- Keep `og_description` aligned with a solid `perex` / `excerpt` (2–3 sentences)

## Wiring

`og_image` must be passed into `BaseLayout` as `ogImage` (absolute `https://www.vzhurudolu.cz…` URL is fine). Relative paths starting with `/` are absolutized in article templates.
